* Self-authored two-port fixture for the CI SPICE-stamp check (see ci.yml).
* Two parallel 5 mm x 0.2 mm x 35 um copper bars, 0.5 mm apart, one port
* each, so the SPICE export carries a K mutual and off-diagonal H sources.
.title two parallel bars
.units m
.default z=0 w=2e-4 h=3.5e-5 sigma=5.8e7 nwinc=3 nhinc=2
na x=0 y=0
nb x=5e-3 y=0
nc x=0 y=5e-4
nd x=5e-3 y=5e-4
e1 na nb
e2 nc nd
.external na nb barA
.external nc nd barB
.freq fmin=1e6 fmax=1e9 ndec=1
.end
